{"id":7112,"chapter_id":7,"scene_id":713,"steps":[{"step":1,"content":"三个傀儡逐渐被污染，连空虚傀儡的身上都沾染了黑色火焰。","style":3,"background":709,"log_type":1},{"step":2,"speaker":"选项","options":["我再说一次，让哈梅尔解除幻境！"],"jump":[3],"style":6,"background":709,"log_type":1},{"step":3,"speaker":"玩家","content":"把我的同伴还回来！我们可以战斗，我们要找到真正的敌人，打败它！","style":2,"background":709,"log_type":1},{"step":4,"speaker":"空虚傀儡","content":"不……不可以……不可以打破幻境……","voice":["vo_cgplot_7132004"],"voice_bank":"vo_cgplot_07","style":1,"background":709,"log_type":1},{"step":5,"speaker":"空虚傀儡","content":"我会……保护哈梅尔……","voice":["vo_cgplot_7132005"],"voice_bank":"vo_cgplot_07","style":1,"background":709,"log_type":1},{"step":6,"speaker":"选项","options":["拒绝看清现实的你能保护什么？"],"jump":[7],"style":6,"background":709,"log_type":1},{"step":7,"content":"你对真正的危机视而不见，黑环就在这里，在这里编织美梦只是自欺欺人。它已经夺走我两个同伴了！","style":2,"background":709,"log_type":1},{"step":8,"speaker":"空虚傀儡","content":"反正你也救不了她们，你只有一个人，你无力战斗，无力对抗。","voice":["vo_cgplot_7132008"],"voice_bank":"vo_cgplot_07","style":1,"background":709,"log_type":1},{"step":9,"content":"黑色的火焰淌过幻湖漫上空虚傀儡的身体，它的神智开始模糊，流露出自己最本初的疯狂——是狂厄！","style":3,"background":709,"log_type":1},{"step":10,"speaker":"空虚傀儡","content":"对了，你也来就好了……你也加入游行，跟我们一起沉浸嘉年华，就能再见到她们了……","voice":["vo_cgplot_7132010"],"voice_bank":"vo_cgplot_07","style":1,"background":709,"log_type":1},{"step":11,"speaker":"空虚傀儡","content":"这就是哈梅尔的仁慈，她也会治愈你，让你不再孤独……乐园就是她的愿望。","voice":["vo_cgplot_7132011"],"voice_bank":"vo_cgplot_07","style":1,"background":709,"log_type":1},{"step":12,"content":"她，治愈我？","style":2,"background":709,"log_type":1},{"step":14,"content":"你看向被污染的湖心，哈梅尔几乎要跪倒在地。","style":3,"background":709,"log_type":1},{"step":15,"speaker":"选项","options":["不，她早就知道自己治愈不了任何人"],"jump":[16],"style":6,"background":709,"log_type":1},{"step":16,"speaker":"${PlayerName}","content":"我不否认她的善意，她为了减轻你们的痛苦如此努力，她也许是善良的，我可以相信这个哈梅尔。","style":2,"background":709,"log_type":1},{"step":17,"speaker":"${PlayerName}","content":"可连她都知道，她制造的乐园只是假象。所以她才一直驱逐我，驱逐每一个进入嘉年华的人类。她知道自己带不来真正的救赎。","style":2,"background":709,"log_type":1},{"step":18,"speaker":"空虚傀儡","content":"住口……住口……你懂什么……","voice":["vo_cgplot_7132016"],"voice_bank":"vo_cgplot_07","style":1,"background":709,"log_type":1},{"step":19,"speaker":"空虚傀儡","content":"哈梅尔在为我们跳舞，我们要保护她，我们在保护嘉年华……","voice":["vo_cgplot_7132017"],"voice_bank":"vo_cgplot_07","style":1,"background":709,"log_type":1},{"step":20,"speaker":"选项","options":["你们只是贪恋虚幻的美梦"],"jump":[21],"style":6,"background":709,"log_type":1},{"step":21,"speaker":"${PlayerName}","content":"再这么下去，你们只会带着她的善意，和这个嘉年华一起坠入地狱……！","style":2,"background":709,"log_type":1},{"step":22,"speaker":"？？？","content":"一起坠入地狱……不好吗？","voice":["vo_cgplot_7132020"],"voice_bank":"vo_cgplot_07","style":1,"background":709,"log_type":1},{"step":23,"content":"虚空中传来了那个黑色幻影的轻笑声。","style":3,"background":709,"log_type":1},{"step":24,"content":"你提高了警惕，环顾四周，却没有看到那个黑色幻影出现。","style":3,"background":709,"log_type":1},{"step":25,"speaker":"选项","options":["你是谁？"],"jump":[26],"style":6,"background":709,"log_type":1},{"step":26,"speaker":"？？？","content":"你不记得我啦？是我，哈梅尔，我是哈梅尔呀。","voice":["vo_cgplot_7132024"],"voice_bank":"vo_cgplot_07","style":1,"background":709,"log_type":1},{"step":27,"speaker":"选项","options":["你不是她！"],"jump":[28],"style":6,"background":709,"log_type":1},{"step":28,"speaker":"？？？","content":"呵呵呵，你说得对，还不是。她不让我出来，她总要我……回去睡觉……","voice":["vo_cgplot_7132026"],"voice_bank":"vo_cgplot_07","style":1,"background":709,"log_type":1},{"step":29,"speaker":"？？？","content":"可我也想跟她跳舞，想跟大家一起快乐，我也想要大家的爱……","voice":["vo_cgplot_7132027"],"voice_bank":"vo_cgplot_07","style":1,"background":709,"log_type":1},{"step":30,"content":"傀儡们身上的黑色火焰随着“哈梅尔”的声音变得更加可怖。","style":3,"background":709,"log_type":1},{"step":31,"speaker":"？？？","content":"不要紧，我马上要自由了……亲爱的，我会来你们身边，我来爱你们，我给你们真正的乐园。","voice":["vo_cgplot_7132029"],"voice_bank":"vo_cgplot_07","style":1,"background":709,"log_type":1},{"step":32,"speaker":"选项","options":["你在哪里？！"],"jump":[33],"style":6,"background":709,"log_type":1},{"step":33,"speaker":"？？？","content":"我无处不在，我才是黑环的主人，这里是我的狂欢……","voice":["vo_cgplot_7132031"],"voice_bank":"vo_cgplot_07","style":1,"background":709,"log_type":1},{"step":34,"content":"你不再跟这虚无的声音纠缠，转而向湖心的幻影大声呼喊。","style":3,"background":709,"log_type":1},{"step":35,"speaker":"选项","options":["哈梅尔，解除幻境！"],"jump":[36],"style":6,"background":709,"log_type":1},{"step":36,"content":"把我的禁闭者还回来！我要战斗！！","style":2,"background":709,"log_type":1},{"step":37,"speaker":"？？？","content":"没用的，那只是个幻影，被设定好的执着。哈梅尔舍不得它们受苦，她会永远跳下去，直到终结。","voice":["vo_cgplot_7132033"],"voice_bank":"vo_cgplot_07","style":1,"background":709,"log_type":1},{"step":38,"content":"纯白的哈梅尔没有回应，她还在起舞，却已经难以彻底净化玩偶们身上的黑火了。旋转的舞裙像白色的雪花，在舞动之中渐渐融化。","style":3,"background":709,"log_type":1},{"step":39,"speaker":"选项","options":["解除幻境，让我回到现实战斗！"],"jump":[40],"style":6,"background":709,"log_type":1},{"step":40,"speaker":"空虚&恐惧&苦痛","content":"不——！！","voice":["vo_cgplot_7132036"],"voice_bank":"vo_cgplot_07","style":1,"background":709,"log_type":1},{"step":41,"content":"漆黑的能量球将你击倒，挡在你面前的，是三个被黑焰彻底笼罩的傀儡，还有无数簇拥而来的玩偶。","style":3,"background":709,"log_type":1},{"step":42,"speaker":"空虚&恐惧&苦痛","content":"这是……我们的乐园……","voice":["vo_cgplot_7132038"],"voice_bank":"vo_cgplot_07","style":1,"background":709,"log_type":1},{"step":43,"speaker":"玩偶们","content":"驱逐他！驱逐他！","female_content":"驱逐她！驱逐她！","voice":["vo_cgplot_7132039","vo_cgplot_7132039f"],"voice_bank":"vo_cgplot_07","style":1,"background":709,"log_type":1},{"step":44,"speaker":"空虚&恐惧&苦痛","content":"谁也不能……破坏……我们的……乐园……！！","voice":["vo_cgplot_7132040"],"voice_bank":"vo_cgplot_07","style":1,"background":709,"log_type":1},{"step":45,"speaker":"玩偶们","content":"阻止他！阻止他！","female_content":"阻止她！阻止她！","voice":["vo_cgplot_7132041","vo_cgplot_7132041f"],"voice_bank":"vo_cgplot_07","style":1,"background":709,"log_type":1},{"step":46,"speaker":"选项","options":["站起来，战斗"],"jump":[47],"style":6,"background":709,"log_type":1},{"step":47,"content":"你从被污染的幻湖湖面站了起来，力量汇聚在掌心。","style":3,"background":709,"log_type":1},{"step":48,"speaker":"？？？","content":"不痛吗？在这里使用这种力量，你已经很累了吧？还看得清眼前吗？","voice":["vo_cgplot_7132044"],"voice_bank":"vo_cgplot_07","style":1,"background":709,"log_type":1},{"step":49,"content":"你的视野变得模糊，耳边的声音忽远忽近。从舞姬身上散发蓝色微光试图减轻你的负担，但它很快也被污染吞噬。","style":3,"background":709,"log_type":1},{"step":50,"content":"你被污染的人群包围，它们推搡你，撕扯你。你依旧紧握枷锁不放，可枷锁的另一头无人回应。","style":3,"background":709,"log_type":1},{"step":51,"options":["唤醒权能，继续战斗！"],"jump":[53],"style":6,"background":709,"log_type":1},{"step":53,"speaker":"？？？","content":"还要抵抗吗？真可怜……明明只剩你一个人了……","voice":["vo_cgplot_7132048"],"voice_bank":"vo_cgplot_07","style":1,"background":709,"log_type":1},{"step":54,"speaker":"选项","options":["即使如此……我也……"],"jump":[55],"style":6,"background":709,"log_type":1}]}